{"4745980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cow", "steam_appid": 4745980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4945710], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Arcade Chaos</strong> Welcome to <strong>Cow</strong>. No bloated storylines, no unskippable cutscenes—just straight-up, fast-paced gameplay. Grab your skateboard and conquer 60+ unique and increasingly difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/1b543f3328be7fd38ec2809bc616d3d6.poster.avif?t=1787525536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/1b543f3328be7fd38ec2809bc616d3d6.webm?t=1787525536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/1b543f3328be7fd38ec2809bc616d3d6.mp4?t=1787525536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shred and Survive</strong> Reaching the finish line won't be easy. You'll need perfect timing and quick reflexes to kickflip over spiked balls, dodge rogue police cars hot on your tail, and avoid blinding milk attacks. Keep your momentum up and chain together tricks for high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Awesome Skins</strong> What's a skateboarding cow without some style? Collect steaks scattered throughout the levels to unlock a massive wardrobe of hilarious and awesome skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/fa105220fce8051989449580134540c1.poster.avif?t=1787525536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/fa105220fce8051989449580134540c1.webm?t=1787525536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/fa105220fce8051989449580134540c1.mp4?t=1787525536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Diverse Levels:</strong> A steady difficulty curve from the bunny hills to absolute physics-based chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Obstacles:</strong> Evade cops, dodge swinging hammers, and outrun rolling spiked balls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Cosmetics:</strong> Gather steaks and hit high scores to unlock fresh new skins for your cow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Up and Play:</strong> Instant respawns and zero downtime. Just pure gameplay.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Arcade Chaos</strong> Welcome to <strong>Cow</strong>. No bloated storylines, no unskippable cutscenes—just straight-up, fast-paced gameplay. Grab your skateboard and conquer 60+ unique and increasingly difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/1b543f3328be7fd38ec2809bc616d3d6.poster.avif?t=1787525536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/1b543f3328be7fd38ec2809bc616d3d6.webm?t=1787525536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4745980/extras/1b543f3328be